  "description": "<h2>ENGWE EP-2 Pro Features</h2>\n<p>1. 3-step foldable and compact bike frame</p>\n<p>2. 250W European compliant motor &amp; 25km/h top speed</p>\n<p>3. Shimano 7-speed &amp; 3 riding modes</p>\n<p>4. 20-inch fat tires for a variety of terrains</p>\n<p>5. 48V 13Ah battery for up to 120 km of range</p>\n<h2>What About EP-2 Pro?</h2>\n<p>The ENGWE EP-2 Pro is a versatile and powerful folding electric bike for commuting and adventure. Its 250W motor and 25km/h top speed make it a legal road e-bike. At the same time, its range is excellent, with up to 120km on a single charge, so you can use it for long-distance commuting with peace of mind. Not only that, this fat tire e-bike also features 20x4-inch tires, providing excellent traction and stability on a variety of surfaces such as beaches, snowy roads and rocky trails, making it the perfect all-terrain e-bike. You can also use it as a mountain bike.</p>\n<p>Whether you are exploring off-road trails or driving on city streets, the ENGWE EP-2 Pro combines style, function and durability, making it an ideal choice for those who seek adventure without compromising practicality.</p>\n<h2>ENGWE Engine Pro 2.0 Off-road E-bike Spec</h2>\n<table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor</td>\n<td>250W Brushless Motor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Torque</td>\n<td>55 Nm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brake</td>\n<td>160mm Front &amp; Rear Disc Mechanical Brake</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top Speed</td>\n<td>25km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Mileage</td>\n<td>40 km (Electric Mode); 120km (PAS 1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Battery</td>\n<td>48V 13Ah Lithium-ion Battery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging Time</td>\n<td>About 6.5 hours</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tires</td>\n<td>20x4.0\" Fat Tires</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Climbing degree</td>\n<td>10\u00b0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transmission System</td>\n<td>Shimano 7 Gears</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>LCD Display</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bike Weight</td>\n<td>30 kg (66 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gross Weight</td>\n<td>37.8 kg (80.7 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rider Height</td>\n<td>5.4 (ft) - 6.2 (ft)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Payload Capacity</td>\n<td>150 kg (330 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Size</td>\n<td>99*55*76 cm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
